        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-912-2297"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-915-963"><rb>町立病院</rb><rt>ちやうりつびやうゐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-963-966">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-966-981"><rb>庭</rb><rt>には</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-981-984">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-984-999"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-999-1002">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1002-1023"><rb>牛蒡</rb><rt>ごばう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1023-1026">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1026-1050"><rb>蕁草</rb><rt>いらぐさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1050-1053">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1053-1074"><rb>野麻</rb><rt>のあさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1074-1083">などの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1083-1101"><rb>簇</rb><rt>むらが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1101-1104">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1104-1119"><rb>茂</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1119-1128">つてる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1128-1146"><rb>邊</rb><rt>あたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1146-1152">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1152-1167"><rb>小</rb><rt>さゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1167-1179">やかなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1179-1203"><rb>別室</rb><rt>べつしつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1203-1209">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1209-1227"><rb>棟</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1227-1239">がある。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1239-1257"><rb>屋根</rb><rt>やね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1257-1269">のブリキ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1269-1284"><rb>板</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1284-1287">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1287-1299"><rb>錆</rb><rt>