        <p source="#source-152592-153263"><seg source="#source-152592-152595">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152595-152610"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152610-152613">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152613-152637"><rb>面白</rb><rt>おもしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152637-152640">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152640-152664"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby>だらう。』と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152685-152712"><rb>院長</rb><rt>ゐんちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152712-152715">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152715-152736"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152736-152739">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152739-152754"><rb>室</rb><rt>へや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152754-152757">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152757-152772"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152772-152775">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152775-152790"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152790-152802">りながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152802-152817"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby>ふた。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152829-152844"><rb>此</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152844-152847">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152847-152859"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152859-152868">てから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152868-152901"><rb>何年振</rb><rt>なんねんぶり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152901-152910">かで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152910-152931"><rb>恁云</rb><rt>かうい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152931-152934">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-152934-152949"><rb>共</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152949-152952">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#so