        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-153263-153924"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153266-153281"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153281-153284">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153284-153308"><rb>其後</rb><rt>そのゝち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153308-153332"><rb>讀書</rb><rt>どくしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153332-153335">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153335-153347"><rb>爲</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153347-153350">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153350-153365"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153365-153374">にも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153374-153395"><rb>睡眠</rb><rt>ねむり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153395-153398">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153398-153410"><rb>就</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153410-153458">いてからも、イワン、デミトリチの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153458-153473"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153473-153476">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153476-153494"><rb>頭</rb><rt>あたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153494-153500">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153500-153512"><rb>去</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153512-153521">らず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153521-153545"><rb>翌朝</rb><rt>よくてう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153545-153557"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153557-153560">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153560-153575"><rb>覺</rb><rt>さま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153575-153587">しても、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153587-153608"><rb>昨日</rb><rt>きのふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153608-153611">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153611-153629"><rb>智慧</rb><rt>ちゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153629-153635">ある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153635-153659"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153659-153662">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153662-153674"><rb>遇</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153674-153689">つたことを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153689-153704"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153704-153710">れる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153710-153725"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153725-153728">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153728-153746"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153746-153761">なかつた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153761-153782"><rb>便宜</rb><rt>べんぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153782-153785">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153785-153797"><rb>有</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153797-153812">らばもう一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153812-153827"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153827-153842"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153842-153845">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153845-153863"><rb>是非</rb><rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153863-153878"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153878-153890">ねやうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153890-153905"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153905-153924">ふてゐた。</seg></p>
