        <p source="#source-219378-219604"><seg source="#source-219378-219381">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219381-219399"><rb>今日</rb><rt>けふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219399-219402">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219402-219444"><rb>甚麼御馳走</rb><rt>どんなごちそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219444-219447">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219447-219471"><rb>我々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-219456-219462">われ</seg><choice source="#source-219462-219468"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219471-219474">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219474-219486"><rb>食</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219486-219495">はして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219495-219507"><rb>呉</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby>れるか。』と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219528-219549"><rb>無暗</rb><rt>むやみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219549-219552">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219552-219567"><rb>幅</rb><rt>はゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219567-219570">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219570-219582"><rb>利</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219582-219604">かせたがる。</seg></p>
