        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-233666-234982"><seg source="#source-233666-233732">ドクトル、アンドレイ、エヒミチはベローワと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233732-233744"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233744-233747">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233747-233765"><rb>婦</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233765-233768">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233768-233789"><rb>小汚</rb><rt>こぎた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233789-233795">ない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233795-233810"><rb>家</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233810-233816">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233816-233831"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233831-233834">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233834-233846"><rb>借</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233846-233873">りることになつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233873-233888"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233888-233891">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233891-233906"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233906-233921">のやうに八</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233921-233936"><rb>時</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233936-233939">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233939-233951"><rb>起</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233951-233960">きて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233960-233975"><rb>茶</rb><rt>ちや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233975-233978">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233978-233993"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233993-233996">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233996-234011"><rb>直</rb><rt>すぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-234011-234014">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#sou