        <p source="#source-253918-254790"><seg source="#source-253918-253921">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253921-253936"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-253936-253939">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253939-253960"><rb>彼等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-253960-253963">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253963-253978"><rb>信</rb><rt>しん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-253978-253996">じなさるな。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253996-254011"><rb>嘘</rb><rt>うそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254011-254026">なのです。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254026-254044"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254044-254047">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254047-254071"><rb>病氣</rb><rt>びやうき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254071-254074">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254074-254086"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254086-254095">ふのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254095-254116"><rb>抑</rb><rt><seg source="#source-254101-254107">そも</seg><choice source="#source-254107-254113"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254116-254128"><rb>恁</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254128-254152">うなのです。二十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254152-254179"><rb>年來</rb><rt>ねんらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254179-254182">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254182-254200"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254200-254203">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254203-254215"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254215-254218">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254218-254233"><rb>町</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254233-254242">にゐて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right