        <p source="#source-254790-254885"><seg source="#source-254790-254793">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254793-254820"><rb>病院</rb><rt>びやうゐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254820-254826">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254826-254841"><rb>入</rb><rt>はひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254841-254862">りなさい、ねえ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254862-254877"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby>。』</p>
