        <p source="#source-258066-258245"><seg source="#source-258066-258069">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258069-258090"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258090-258093">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258093-258117"><rb>有仰</rb><rt>おつしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258117-258120">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258120-258147"><rb>病人</rb><rt>びやうにん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258147-258150">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258150-258168"><rb>何處</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby>なのです？、』アンドレイ、エヒミチは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258222-258234"><rb>問</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258234-258245">ふた。</seg></p>
