        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-269269-270141"><seg source="#source-269269-269305">アンドレイ、エヒミチは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269305-269320"><rb>窓</rb><rt>まど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269320-269323">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269323-269341"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269341-269344">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269344-269356"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269356-269362">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269362-269377"><rb>外</rb><rt>そと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269377-269380">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269380-269395"><rb>眺</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269395-269407">むれば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269407-269419"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269419-269428">はもう</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-269428-269476" corresp="#source-269440-269476"><seg source="#source-269428-269440">とツぷり</seg></hi><seg source="#source-269476-269479">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269479-269491"><rb>暮</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269491-269494">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269494-269506"><rb>果</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269506-269515">てゝ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269515-269536"><rb>那方</rb><rt>むかふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269536-269539">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269539-269560"><rb>野廣</rb><rt>のびろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269560-269563">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269563-269578"><rb>畑</rb><rt>はた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269578-269581">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-269581-269596"><rb>暗</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-269596-269611">かつたが、</seg><ruby type=